OL,3,ASales of tinned food and bottled water
OL,4,Ajump after 'Be Ready' campaign launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government's public awareness
OL,7,Fcampaign encouraged people to stock up
OL,8,Fin case of disruption to essential
OL,9,Fservices by severe weather or
OL,10,Fcyberattacks.
OL,12,FHowever, Worldpanel said that while
OL,13,Fhouseholds were stockpiling essentials,
OL,14,Fthey were not panic buying.
